                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_vancouver rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_vancouver rendering_contributiontojournal_vancouver">Liu Y, Wang J, Gao Q, Pan M<a rel="Person" href="https://scholars.cityu.edu.hk/en/persons/yugufang/" class="link"><span>, Fang Y</span></a>. <span class="title"><a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://scholars.cityu.edu.hk/en/publications/robust-device-free-mmwave-sensing-with-specular-reflection-interf/" class="link"><span>Robust Device-Free Mmwave Sensing with Specular Reflection Interference Mitigation</span></a></span>. <a rel="Journal" href="#" class="link"><span>IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing</span></a>. 2025 Jul;24(7):5749-5764. Epub 2025 Feb 3. doi: 10.1109/TMC.2025.3538112</div>
            </div>
        

